<title>USA: Cooper Cameron names two new board members.</title>
<headline>Cooper Cameron names two new board members.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Cameron Corp said on Monday that it named C. Baker Cunningham and Michael Patrick to its board of directors, increasing the size of the board to seven members.</p>
<p>Cunningham has been chairman, president and chief executive of Belden Inc since 1993 and Patrick has been vice president and chief investment officer of Meadows Foundation Inc since 1995, the company said.</p>
